mizuki: bad apartment? [ID:reading_evening.line.2]
asahi: Fine apartment. Very good walls. Nothing on either side I recognized yet. [ID:reading_evening.line.3]
mizuki: mine had a kettle that clicked so loudly i thought someone had come in. i liked the sound anyway. [ID:reading_evening.line.4]
asahi: A page and a window, then. Small enough for a bad week. [ID:reading_evening.line.5]
mizuki: yeah. can skip if we're tired though? don't want book homework [ID:reading_evening.line.6]
