~ family_chat
system: Three people and a shelf [ID:family_chat.title]
misaki: Hi Asahi. You're the book-on-noodles person? [ID:family_chat.line.0]
asahi: The book did most of the work. [ID:family_chat.line.1]
misaki: OK. I'll thank the book. [ID:family_chat.line.2]
mizuki: the team is a paperback with soup on it. [ID:family_chat.line.3]
misaki: I'm moving next month. She's been helping every weekend. If she falls asleep mid-game, that's why. [ID:family_chat.line.4]
mizuki: i can explain my own schedule, you know. [ID:family_chat.line.5]
misaki: Fair. I'll stop. Please keep the shelf photo here. Mum will never let me hear the end of it. [ID:family_chat.line.6]
asahi: Understood. Private archive, questionable carpentry. [ID:family_chat.line.7]
=> END

